sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Policy
    participant Store
    participant Model
    Caller->>Policy: Signed subject + bounded question
    Policy->>Store: Resolve subject and ACL pre-filter
    Store-->>Policy: Authorised evidence or rule inputs
    alt Evidence passes gate
        Policy->>Model: Bounded untrusted evidence
        Model-->>Policy: Extractive proposal or abstention
        Policy->>Policy: Validate all output
    else Rule or insufficient evidence
        Policy->>Policy: Code-owned result or no-answer
    end
    Policy->>Store: Commit trace before release
    Store-->>Policy: Success or failure
    Policy-->>Caller: Verified result or generic failure
